window.docContents[241].resolve({"/Standards-Reference-___-PKC-beside-ISO-80000-1-and-the-VIM/#standards-reference":{"contents":"The rest of this blueprint follows Dybkær's section numbers. A standard that cites this\nwork for its formal definitions will cite ISO 80000-1 and the International Vocabulary of\nMetrology (VIM) for the terms. This chapter is the bridge: for each definition of the\ncore calculus that a vocabulary of quantities, units and numbers needs, it gives the Lean\ndeclaration, the Dybkær section the source file names, and the corresponding term and\nclause of ISO 80000-1 and of the VIM, in one row. Under each table it says where the\nsources agree and where this work, or Dybkær, departs from ISO 80000-1 and the VIM.\n\nOnly locators and terms are recorded. No definition, note or example of a copyrighted\nsource is reproduced.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"A Property Kind Calculus for Metrology: proving quantity and unit laws in Lean, from ISO/IEC 80000 to measurement uncertainty","header":"34. Standards Reference — PKC beside ISO 80000-1 and the VIM","id":"/Standards-Reference-___-PKC-beside-ISO-80000-1-and-the-VIM/#standards-reference"}});